  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">l</mtext></math> be the length of the string.<br /><br />The fundamental frequency is given by<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#957;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>or</mtext><mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace><mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#957;</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;(&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></math>&nbsp;are constant )&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>or</mtext><mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace><mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#957;</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;( where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math>&nbsp;is a constant )<br /><br />Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#957;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#957;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#957;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#957;</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br />But&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">l</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">l</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">l</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">l</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#957;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#957;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#957;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#957;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfrac></math>",
